<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Diagnostics of representation assumptions on GPT-2 small.
Reported values are averages across 500 prompts with 95% bootstrap confidence intervals in parentheses.</figcaption>
