<th id="A5.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><math id="A5.T6.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{\text{emp}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>emp</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{\text{emp}}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="A5.T6.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><math id="A5.T6.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta K</annotation></semantics></math></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A5.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><math id="A5.T6.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\infty</annotation></semantics></math> (Gaussian)</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">64</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">62 <math id="A5.T6.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> 4</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">-2</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T6.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">10</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">64</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">70 <math id="A5.T6.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> 5</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T6.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">5</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">64</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">92 <math id="A5.T6.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> 7</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">28</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T6.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">3</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">64</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">120 <math id="A5.T6.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> 9</td>
<td id="A5.T6.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">56</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<section id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Observation.</h5>

<div id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Heavier tails inflate the required prompt length by a multiplicative constant,
but truncation or normalization substantially reduces the inflation.
This behavior aligns with the extended bound in Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Extensions Beyond the Nominal Assumption ‣ Theoretical Bounds for Stable In-Context Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>Temporal Dependence</h3>

<figure id="A5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Dependence stress test results (<math id="A5.T7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=100</annotation></semantics></math>).
<math id="A5.T7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{\mathrm{nominal}}=32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>nominal</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{\mathrm{nominal}}=32</annotation></semantics></math>.
Effective sample size <math id="A5.T7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{\mathrm{eff}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>eff</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{\mathrm{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math> decreases with <math id="A5.T7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ρ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
